The icon paths are embedded in public/index.html as an inline SVG symbol
sheet, generated by tools/build-icons.js from the @fluentui/svg-icons
package. Regenerating them is only necessary when changing the icon set;
a normal clone needs no build step.

The Horizon brand mark (public/brand/mark.svg, and the generated icons in
public/brand) is original work and is not part of the Microsoft icon set.
A small number of interface glyphs are also original, drawn directly in
tools/build-html.js.

